 amplification-associated stronger ERBB2 dependency in adenocarcinoma. Several driver-amplification or driver-mutation effects remain unresolved but not accepted because their estimates are small or intervals span null, including EGFR amplification, KRAS mutation effects on KRAS dependency, and ERBB2 amplification globally. The next best use of analysis capacity is to complete the untested mechanistic bypass and proliferation hypotheses H15 and H27-H33, examine PTEN/STAT3 context dependence through H34-H35 and the two new interactions, and then reserve validation for any new large or surprising effect that cannot be resolved by robustness checks.",
